210_FBC_AB\u30c6\u30b9\u30c80630 (8).png", "id": "3681961321979666", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628909_3681961325312999_3314807553444507439_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BX8VMkWBJRMQ7kNvwGkY7IF&_nc_oc=Adp-VcXgQYELH9bpd2mru82uII7cOaXwieL6S49CdY6Df5sW75nZT5_4wPuIPkYmI7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQL3eiHOdbhrT7nt1gdPWk-CwVpSFEUCRNShTlMc162Ng&oe=6AFDB31A"}, "display_name": "Camp Fire MR", "keywords": ["Campfire", "Hearth", "Zen", "Relaxation", "Meditation"], "long_description": "# BRING CALM TO YOUR REALITY\nIn a world of noise, find your quiet center. Campfire MR is a simple, free Early Access tool that uses the power of Mixed Reality (MR) to bring the warmth and tranquility of a campfire into your personal space.\n\n\n# YOUR PERSONAL MR SANCTUARY\nCampfire MR is not a game  or a complex guided meditation app. It is a focused utility  designed for one purpose: to create a \"soothing ambiance\"  that enhances your environment.   \n", "short_description": "Campfire MR is a simple, beautiful Mixed Reality tool that places a cozy campfire right in your living room, bedroom, or office. \nNo guides, no goals. Just pure, simple ambiance.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_